飞牛 md_io_clone 多了 rdev 字段(hdr 子任务已加), raid0/linear 在 md_account_bio 之后
把 bio 实际落到的成员盘记进 md_io_clone->rdev(反汇编: raid0_make_request/linear_make_request
里 `mov bi_private,%rax; mov rdev,0x8(%rax)`), 供 md.c 的 md_end_clone_io 做
degradation free recover。飞牛 md_account_bio 总是克隆, 所以 bi_private 一定是 md_io_clone。
函数名是还原时起的(飞牛里是内联, 名字不可考), 合并时若 md.c 子任务有同义函数可以统一。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/md/md.h | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/md/md.h b/drivers/md/md.h
index fcd265e58..6e30bb290 100644
--- a/drivers/md/md.h
+++ b/drivers/md/md.h
@@ -1151,6 +1151,17 @@ static inline bool md_cloned_bio(struct mddev *mddev, struct bio *bio)
 	return bio->bi_pool == &mddev->io_clone_set;
 }
 
+/*
+ * fnnas: remember which member disk an accounted (md_account_bio) bio was
+ * mapped to, md_end_clone_io uses it for degradation free recover.
+ */
+static inline void md_clone_set_rdev(struct bio *bio, struct md_rdev *rdev)
+{
+	struct md_io_clone *md_io_clone = bio->bi_private;
+
+	md_io_clone->rdev = rdev;
+}
+
 /*
  * MD devices can be used undeneath by DM, in which case ->gendisk is NULL.
  */
